   "source": [
    "___INTO TO STATISTICS:-\n",
    "- Mathematical appraoach towards data set.\n",
    "- Statistics are of 2 types:-\n",
    "    1.Descriptive - applied on small data set.\n",
    "        a. Measure of central tendency (mean,mode,median).\n",
    "        b. Measure of spread or dispersion (quartiles,range,std or variance)\n",
    "        c. Application of the above two in data frame.\n",
    "    2.Inferential - appllied on large data set.\n",
    "        a. Confidence Interval\n",
    "        b. Hypothesis Testing (t-test,z-test, chi2-test)\n",
    "        c. Central Limit Theorem\n",
    "        d. Regression Analysis (logistic, linear)"
   ]
